WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Flows is an options-flow research site for US equities.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:12.800
The Home page gathers the day’s flow into a bento of cards.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:22.000
The Market Floor view lays out flagged options activity across sectors.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.200
The Session river shows how premium moved through the trading day.

5
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:38.400
A ticker page details one name’s contracts, strikes and expiries.

6
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:45.600
The Status page shows feed health and job timings for the owner.

7
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:52.800
The Ask dock opens on Home for questions about the flow.

8
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:57.400
Fire and Forget. All figures are sample data and not advice.
